&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rW6M0BK7TjkQ7kNvwFDRtv8&_nc_oc=Ado5LOTp0X3OPgiNiM0vPH70_6z3k_PembylSwG0BZLxsPZCXfFMIRakfGu9imMey3c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTwinFJ5T31eg_IwkpRNCAu4sLIkhb2j_bCkbQAtSQsBQ&oe=6AF5C087"}, {"file_name": "store-04-source-assembly.png", "id": "1548633643226364", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824318_1548633646559697_7297799975838773294_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qb7W0gNGKXEQ7kNvwHRmrAQ&_nc_oc=AdqrOBRZ3EhuUVrHXPztoZS-21TwErpgnQwJFNcDcTClB-DXxoldUVoL9A4B_80ojoY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQNv-x8Vx1uRp4VnVNyQClRExQcjv7w6LlmsAumLc5s9Q&oe=6AF5BF20"}, {"file_name": "store-03-blue-hologram.png", "id": "1160826089604529", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825563_1160826092937862_5729086189951941997_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PydOV1cOhPUQ7kNvwETNTGd&_nc_oc=AdoQNjAl1pBwZzrGS2tOg-rueKznODM_lI-87LDJyW5Tlevilm-zn9uiPPrkoifVj8o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSlHCRtRtsj627QpclRx7hiY9zSFZFYxIPQEepOC7_XoA&oe=6AF5C8A2"}, {"file_name": "store-06-source-joints.png", "id": "1613021433699869", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823746_1613021437033202_467147905405238580_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WFd_-xsAwGgQ7kNvwGL7IHX&_nc_oc=Ado6FoJbONWB4EtQDiO7gPkPAvQDifiksof1ZwD8qCbrpOZdE6w7LJ2cRn92RAOVLYI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS0iEHrtNlVGyDvER8F-c1Jt4FIPsegrJQQdcUDb03wzQ&oe=6AF5EF81"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer-cover.png", "id": "2160832664821064", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824665_2160832668154397_1522314912689723401_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E8IT84g5sDIQ7kNvwHYXKsd&_nc_oc=Adpj4q6ASs9uTGv7FGE5QL-73k8DnRS45pMfEDNACGX21E0jO1I3tTbc7oByDqC83Qo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ9LTsrLTrzlqbnyf0vUrU306-HKtJ8_-Ix0chqWFLt7A&oe=6AF5DD92"}, "display_name": "RobotAtlas", "keywords": ["Robot", "3D", "Holo", "Humanoid", "Machines"], "long_description": "Explore published robot models in 3D.\n\nRobot Atlas is an independent visualization app by Nebulytic for Meta Quest 3. Browse 71 models grouped by source company, then inspect one on a movable glass base. Resize the rack, toolbar and model to suit your space.\n\nChoose passthrough, Studio or Black. Switch between full source colour, colour hologram, blue hologram, see-through and exploded assembly views. Exploded view separates only the parts actually included in a source; it does not reveal missing geometry.\n\n70 models use exterior or simplified simulation geometry. ODRI Bolt contains a partial engineering assembly, without complete wiring, battery, camera or factory documentation. Detailed internal systems are generally absent. Published units and materials are source data, not certified real-world dimensions or finishes.\n\nThe UR5e supports six verified source-defined joints for kinematic inspection. Import your own self-contained static GLB files (up to 64 MiB and 250,000 triangles). Imports remain on your headset; skinned, animated and compressed models are unsupported.\n\nYou purchase the viewer software. Third-party models remain under their original licences, with credits in the app. Source names identify the robots; no manufacturer endorsement is implied. Internet is needed for uncached collection models.\n", "short_description": "View 71 published robot models in mixed reality or a virtual room. Rotate, resize, change visual style and separate source parts. Import your own static GLB files. Most included sources show exterior or simplified simulation geometry; detailed internals are generally absent.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://nebulytic.com/apps/robot-atlas/privacy", "developer_terms_of_serv